      },
      "message": "Preserve measured costs beneath unmeasured parent runs\n\nKeep measured prefixes in known totals unless a measured inclusive ancestor covers the same cost item and unit. Report invalid ancestry, units and values explicitly while keeping cost validity separate from task acceptance.\n\nExport the source correction with 21 portable regressions and a public-parent comparison: the same 15 exposed controls improve from 7/15 to 15/15, while unchanged D05 costs and outcomes are preserved."
    },
    {
      "sha": "b2154564f8ad63c8cc0568afe25921ee027a49ea",
      "parents": [
        "b758528c632b187711be77db1a11485279c279fe"
      ],
