      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Daniel Wahnich",
        "email": "cogitoergosum143@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-10-14T11:08:27Z"
      },
      "message": "Expose cost validity in the default text report\n\nShow partial and invalid cost states, unavailable totals and the reasons a cost total cannot be used. Keep task acceptance separate and preserve historical records without inventing a status.\n\nThe same 22 regression cases give 19 passes and three missing-status failures with the previous renderer; the corrected renderer passes all 22 locally. Accounting inputs and historical outcomes are unchanged."
    },
    {
      "sha": "736db9ddea280fd8c8ec439f539e68d12eaef654",
