      },
      "message": "Record clean-clone verification of cost reports\n\nRetain the public-source check: 1,199 passed, 80 explicit skips, lint, 482 formatting checks and 145 documents. All 22 accounting and report regressions run without skips, and the 15-control historical readback remains unchanged.\n\nRecord the installed CLI outputs, earlier attempts and source bindings. The clean clone has only public Git ancestry but shares the host; hosted platform checks remain a separate qualification."
    }
